{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107600","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710760001:1":{"text":"여, 여긴... 정말 고대의 전당인가요?!","source_cn":"……这、这里真的是圣古堂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x474D515DB30CFDBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710760002:1":{"text":"더는 못 참겠어요! 무언가 기어다니는 소리가 들리는 것 같다고요...","source_cn":"我受不了了！我好像听到了什么东西在爬……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE01C3D016BEFC6A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710760003:1":{"text":"몬니 공작, 진정하십시오!","source_cn":"梦妮，镇定点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5FBF0F3CD41966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710760004:1":{"text":"...믿고 싶진 않지만, 지난번에 왔을 때도...","source_cn":"……虽然我也不愿相信，但这里，我上次来的时候——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC21378BE6054309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710760005:1":{"text":"타니스 백작! 지난번에... 무슨 일이 있었죠?","source_cn":"坦尼斯！上次……上次你们遇到了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B2B47E7FE46C223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710760006:1":{"text":"마물... 파도처럼 밀려오는 마물을 만났지요. ","source_cn":"……魔物。如潮水一般汹涌而来的魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E93524A0C6FE60E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710760007:1":{"text":"저, 저희는 막아낼 수 없었어요.","source_cn":"我们、我们根本无法抵抗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA94B54B159C6AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710760008:1":{"text":"살려주세요! 듀라 님이시여!","source_cn":"救命啊！艾雅保佑——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45463556F39A1B05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710760009:1":{"text":"조용히 하십시오!","source_cn":"公爵大人，噤声！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63F5B9BCE34338CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710760010:1":{"text":"걱정 마십시오. 결국 모두 무사했습니다!","source_cn":"别担心，我们最后都没事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8FB8256539E7DC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710760011:1":{"text":"고대의 전당에 모셔진 칼리번이, 마치 대제님께서 강림하신 듯 성스러운 빛을 뿜으며 저희를 구해주었으니까요!","source_cn":"圣古堂中供奉的石中剑仿佛是大帝显灵，爆发出了圣光！那把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34678B79D904F416","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710760012:1":{"text":"성스러운 빛...? 타니스 백작, 이번에도... 그 빛이 다시 나타날 거라 확신합니까? ","source_cn":"圣光……？坦尼斯伯爵，你确定这次……那圣光还会再出现吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1986BA924FA52E17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710760013:1":{"text":"저희는 분명 왕자님의 만찬에 참석 중이었는데...","source_cn":"毕竟我们，明明都在王子的晚宴上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6FA9C654E1273F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710760014:1":{"text":"왕자님은요? 오리안 왕자님께서도 여기 계신가요?","source_cn":"王子殿下呢？奥利安殿下也在这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F1D9B2C0775046","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710760015:1":{"text":"왕자님을 찾아야 합니다! 저희 모두 왕자님의 초대를 받았잖습니까!","source_cn":"我们得找到王子殿下！我们是他的客人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B291BDE2FA43FEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710760016:1":{"text":"사냥터에서도 그렇게 용맹하셨던 분이시니, 분명 여기서도 저희를 구해주시겠죠! ","source_cn":"殿下在猎场上何等英勇，他如果也在这里，一定会保护我们的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34C9996583FC9DF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:女公爵梦妮":{"text":"몬니 공작","source":"女公爵梦妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伯爵坦尼斯":{"text":"타니스 백작","source":"伯爵坦尼斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大臣康斯曼":{"text":"콘스만 대신","source":"大臣康斯曼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:男爵葛朗台":{"text":"그랑데트 남작","source":"男爵葛朗台","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":4}}